<%= @inviter_name || "Your coach" %> recorded a player profile for you at Beach
Volleyball Project and invited you to link it to your account.

Sign in to the account you use, then open this link to request the claim:

<%= @claim_url %>

The link expires in <%= pluralize(@expires_in.inspect, "day") %> and can only be
used once. The profile stays unlinked until a coach or administrator approves
your request, so nothing changes before then.

If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email — the invitation
expires on its own.